{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995","id":2386439380,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6OPizU","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103995.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103995","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103995/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103995/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b445ddc9e107a790f0b31fd89d1327379da3e6db","number":103995,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[GDScript]: Fix some off by one stack space checks in various opcodes.","user":{"login":"Macksaur","id":86566939,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTY2OTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86566939?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur","html_url":"https://github.com/Macksaur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Macksaur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Some of the `CHECK_SPACE` calls seem to be off by one. To read `code[ip + x]` within an opcode, `CHECK_SPACE(x + 1)` has to have been verified to ensure a read doesn't occur out of bounds.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nA good already well-behaving opcode is `OPCODE_TYPE_TEST_BUILTIN`, it looks like this:\r\n```\r\n0: OPCODE_TYPE_TEST_BUILTIN\r\n1: <destination>\r\n2: <value>\r\n3: <builtin type>\r\n```\r\nIt only ever reads up to `code[ip + 3]` and does `CHECK_SPACE(4)` to make sure it is safe.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe `LOAD_INSTRUCTION_ARGS` opcodes also have a similar off by one because they have to read `[opcode][argc][arg0][arg1]...`. Even though the IP has been advanced by that macro it still has to `+1` for stepping over `[argc]` in the same way as it would have for `[opcode]`. So I also fixed those in the same manner.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akie